      <title>硅谷“抢人大战”杀疯了！Meta怒挖OpenAI墙角：GPT-4大神竟被“偷”走了？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/metaopenaigpt-4-20250726091005287-0/</link>
